    "abstract": "Eastman Kodak Co. conducted a survey to evaluate the picture quality of film through the newer generation of CCD and flying-spot telecines. In all cases, the telecines produced good quality. However, operators expressed a need for suitable and easy-to-use alignment materials for telecines and monitors. This article describes a Telecine Analysis Film (TAF) and the Eastman Color Monitor Analyzer (ECMA), developed to meet this need.",
